<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 3.1 bln levs 15-mth T-notes.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 3.1 bln levs 15-mth T-notes.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer 3.1 billion levs of 15-month coupon T-notes at an auction on Friday, the Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) said.</p>
<p>The issue has a floater coupon equal to the BNB's central interest rate for the period to maturity. The CIR is now set at an annual 300 percent.</p>
<p>The issue was offered with no minimum acceptable price set in advance by the ministry. Coupon payments are due quarterly.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	 BG 2032696127</p>
<p> Type		   Floater coupon</p>
<p> Par value	    3.1 bln levs</p>
<p> Auction date	 September 27, 1996</p>
<p> Issue date	   October 3, 1996</p>
<p> Maturity date	January 1, 1998</p>
<p>Interest payments  January 2, 1997; April 3, 1997;</p>
<p>			  July 3, 1997; October 2, 1997;</p>
<p>			  January 1, 1998</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
